OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after Belfast's Big
OL,4,AFish sculpture damaged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after one of
OL,7,FBelfast's most iconic sculptures was
OL,8,Fdamaged in the early hours of Sunday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FPolice said they received a report at
OL,12,F12:30 BST that someone had been seen
OL,13,Fcausing damage to the Big Fish
OL,14,Fsculpture in the Donegall Quay area.
OL,16,FOfficers attended and observed that
OL,17,Fsignificant damage had been caused to
OL,18,Fthe left eye of the sculpture.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
